# Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth entering after Multiversal Passage: Passage's older effect sets it to Island (CR 305.7),
# then Urborg's newer one adds Swamp (CR 613.7, no dependency either way), so Passage is an Island and a Swamp and
# taps for black as well as blue (CR 305.6).

[Bot1 Deck]
Multiversal Passage
Plains
Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Multiversal Passage.Play
Bot1.Modes(Island)
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Multiversal Passage.Activate(Ability: Add {B})

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Mana = {B}
Bot1.Battlefield.Multiversal Passage.Subtypes = Island; Swamp
